{"page":89,"width":1867,"height":2411,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"과목 I 데이터 모일렁!의 이해","words":[{"text":"과목","x":211,"y":90,"width":57,"height":29},{"text":"I","x":294,"y":92,"width":12,"height":26},{"text":"데이터","x":331,"y":91,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"모일렁!의","x":427,"y":91,"width":107,"height":30},{"text":"이해","x":551,"y":91,"width":53,"height":29}]},{"text":"검증하괴 다른 방법은 없는지를 검토한 후 반정규화를 적용해야 한다. 즉 반정규화는 꼭 필요할 때에만 적용해야","words":[{"text":"검증하괴","x":209,"y":233,"width":123,"height":34},{"text":"다른","x":346,"y":233,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"방법은","x":415,"y":232,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"없는지를","x":512,"y":232,"width":112,"height":32},{"text":"검토한","x":638,"y":232,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"후","x":734,"y":233,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"반정규화를","x":775,"y":232,"width":140,"height":32},{"text":"적용해야","x":927,"y":232,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"한다.","x":1050,"y":232,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"즉","x":1128,"y":234,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"반정규화는","x":1168,"y":230,"width":142,"height":32},{"text":"꼭","x":1321,"y":232,"width":30,"height":30},{"text":"필요할","x":1362,"y":229,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"때에만","x":1459,"y":229,"width":89,"height":33},{"text":"적용해야","x":1560,"y":229,"width":121,"height":33}]},{"text":"나. 반정규화를 적용한 모일에서 성능이 저하될 수 있는 경우","words":[{"text":"나.","x":204,"y":384,"width":38,"height":33},{"text":"반정규화를","x":260,"y":383,"width":148,"height":33},{"text":"적용한","x":422,"y":382,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"모일에서","x":523,"y":383,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"성능이","x":655,"y":384,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"저하될","x":756,"y":384,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"수","x":857,"y":385,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"있는","x":902,"y":383,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"경우","x":974,"y":384,"width":59,"height":33}]},{"text":"반정규화는 항상 빠른 성능을 보장할까? 실무에서 자주 듣는 소리 중 하나는 \u0027조인을 하면 성능이 느려진다\u0027라는","words":[{"text":"반정규화는","x":239,"y":455,"width":144,"height":32},{"text":"항상","x":394,"y":454,"width":58,"height":33},{"text":"빠른","x":462,"y":454,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"성능을","x":531,"y":454,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"보장할까?","x":625,"y":456,"width":125,"height":32},{"text":"실무에서","x":764,"y":456,"width":108,"height":32},{"text":"자주","x":885,"y":455,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"듣는","x":952,"y":457,"width":58,"height":30},{"text":"소리","x":1020,"y":456,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"중","x":1088,"y":458,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"하나는","x":1128,"y":454,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"\u0027조인을","x":1226,"y":455,"width":93,"height":32},{"text":"하면","x":1328,"y":456,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"성능이","x":1399,"y":457,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"느려진다\u0027라는","x":1497,"y":456,"width":183,"height":33}]},{"text":"말이다. 한 개의 테이불을 읽어서 데이터를 가져오는 것이 두 개의 테이블을 조인하여 데이터를 가져오는 것보다","words":[{"text":"말이다.","x":201,"y":506,"width":95,"height":32},{"text":"한","x":310,"y":506,"width":30,"height":32},{"text":"개의","x":353,"y":506,"width":54,"height":32},{"text":"테이불을","x":422,"y":505,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"읽어서","x":549,"y":505,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"데이터를","x":646,"y":506,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"가져오는","x":772,"y":506,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"것이","x":898,"y":505,"width":52,"height":33},{"text":"두","x":965,"y":509,"width":31,"height":29},{"text":"개의","x":1007,"y":506,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"테이블을","x":1077,"y":506,"width":114,"height":33},{"text":"조인하여","x":1204,"y":506,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"데이터를","x":1332,"y":507,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"가져오는","x":1461,"y":508,"width":118,"height":33},{"text":"것보다","x":1592,"y":508,"width":88,"height":34}]},{"text":"조금이라도 빠르기는 할 것이므로 이런 관점에서 본다면 일리가 있다.","words":[{"text":"조금이라도","x":199,"y":558,"width":148,"height":33},{"text":"빠르기는","x":361,"y":558,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":490,"y":557,"width":30,"height":33},{"text":"것이므로","x":536,"y":557,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"이런","x":665,"y":559,"width":55,"height":32},{"text":"관점에서","x":735,"y